#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:184
msgid "smudge"
msgstr "Verwischen"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:184
msgid ""
"Paint with the smudge color instead of the brush color. The smudge color is slowly changed to the color you are painting on.\n"
" 0.0 do not use the smudge color\n"
" 0.5 mix the smudge color with the brush color\n"
" 1.0 use only the smudge color"
msgstr ""
"Mit de Klöör för't Verwischen malen, ansteed mit de Pinselklöör. De Verwischen-Klöör warrt suutje na de aktuelle Maalklöör hen ännert.\n"
" 0.0 - keen Verwischen-Klöör bruken\n"
" 0.5 - Verwischen-Klöör un Maalklöör mischen\n"
" 1.0 - bloots de Verwischen-Klöör bruken"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:185
msgid "smudge length"
msgstr "Verwischenduer"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:185
msgid ""
"This controls how fast the smudge color becomes the color you are painting on.\n"
"0.0 immediately change the smudge color\n"
"1.0 never change the smudge color"
msgstr ""
"Dit leggt fast, wo gau de Verwischenklöör na de aktuelle Maalklöör ännert warrt.\n"
"0.0 - Verwischenklöör direktemang ännern\n"
"1.0 - Verwischenklöör nienich ännern"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:186
msgid "smudge radius"
msgstr "Verwischen-Halfmaat"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:186
msgid ""
"This modifies the radius of the circle where color is picked up for smudging.\n"
" 0.0 use the brush radius \n"
"-0.7 half the brush radius\n"
"+0.7 twice the brush radius\n"
"+1.6 five times the brush radius (slow)"
msgstr ""

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:187
msgid "eraser"
msgstr "Radeergummi"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:187
msgid ""
"how much this tool behaves like an eraser\n"
" 0.0 normal painting\n"
" 1.0 standard eraser\n"
" 0.5 pixels go towards 50% transparency"
msgstr ""
"Wo dannig utradeert warrt\n"
" 0.0 - normaal Maalbedrief\n"
" 1.0 - Standard-Radeergummi\n"
" 0.5 - Pixels warrt so wat 50% dörsichtiger"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:189
msgid "stroke threshold"
msgstr "Streeksüll"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:189
msgid "How much pressure is needed to start a stroke. This affects the stroke input only. Mypaint does not need a minimal pressure to start drawing."
msgstr "Wo fast Een för en Streek drücken mutt. Dit gellt bloots för de Streekingaav. »Mypaint« bruukt keen Minndruck för't Malen."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:190
msgid "stroke duration"
msgstr "Streekduer"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:190
msgid "How far you have to move until the stroke input reaches 1.0. This value is logarithmic (negative values will not invert the process)."
msgstr "Wo wiet Een trecken mutt, bet de Streekingaav bi 1,0 anlangt. Disse Weert is logaritmisch (negativ Weerten dreiht den Perzess nich üm)."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:191
msgid "stroke hold time"
msgstr "Streek-Holltiet"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:191
msgid ""
"This defines how long the stroke input stays at 1.0. After that it will reset to 0.0 and start growing again, even if the stroke is not yet finished.\n"
"2.0 means twice as long as it takes to go from 0.0 to 1.0\n"
"9.9 and bigger stands for infinite"
msgstr ""
"Fastleggen, wo lang de Streekingaav op 1.0 blifft. Dorna warrt se op 0.0 torüchsett un wasst wedder an, ok wenn de Streek noch nich fardig is.\n"
"2.0 bedüüdt dubbelt so lang as dat vun 0.0 bet 1.0 duert.\n"
"9.9 un mehr bedüüdt »ahn Enn«."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:192
msgid "custom input"
msgstr "Egen Ingaav"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:192
msgid ""
"Set the custom input to this value. If it is slowed down, move it towards this value (see below). The idea is that you make this input depend on a mixture of pressure/speed/whatever, and then make other this depend on this 'custom input' instead of repeating this combination everywhere you need it.\n"
"If you make it change 'by random' you can generate a slow (smooth) random input."
msgstr ""
"Sett de egen Ingaav op dissen Weert. Warrt se to langsam, verschuuv ehr mehr na dissen Weert hen (kiek nerrn). Dit is dorför dacht, dat disse Ingaav vun en Mischen ut Druck/Gauheit/Watjümmers afhangt, un denn wedder annerswat vun even disse »egen Ingaav« afhangt, dormit Een disse Kombinatschoon nich för elk Bruuk nieg opstellen mutt.\n"
"Is instellt, dat sik de Ingaav »tofällig« ännert, denn warrt se suutje (week) un tofällig."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:193
msgid "custom input filter"
msgstr "Egen Ingaavfilter"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:193
msgid ""
"How slow the custom input actually follows the desired value (the one above). This happens at brushdab level (ignoring how much time has past, if brushdabs do not depend on time).\n"
"0.0 no slowdown (changes apply instantly)"
msgstr ""
"Wo suutje de egen Ingaav sik na den instellten Weert (de Weert baven) hen ännert. Dit passeert in de Pinselplackens-Stoop (egaal, woveel Tiet vörbi is, wenn Pinselplackens nich vun de Tiet afhangt).\n"
"0,0 - keen Gauheit-Minnern (Ännern warrt direktemang övernahmen)."

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:195
msgid "elliptical dab: ratio"
msgstr "Elliptsch Placken: Proportschoon"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:195
msgid "aspect ratio of the dabs; must be >= 1.0, where 1.0 means a perfectly round dab. TODO: linearize? start at 0.0 maybe, or log?"
msgstr "Proportschonen för de Plackens; mutt >= 1.0 wesen. 1.0 is en akraat rund Placken. TO DOON: Lineariseren? Villicht bi 0.0 starten, oder loggen?"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:196
msgid "elliptical dab: angle"
msgstr "Elliptsch Placken: Winkel"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:196
msgid ""
"this defines the angle by which eliptical dabs are tilted\n"
" 0.0 horizontal dabs\n"
" 45.0 45 degrees, turned clockwise\n"
" 180.0 horizontal again"
msgstr ""
"Den Winkel fastleggen, üm den elliptsch Plackens dreiht warrt.\n"
" 0,0 - kimmrecht Plackens\n"
" 45,0 - 45 Graad, in Klockricht dreihen 180,0 - wedder kimmrecht"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:197
msgid "direction filter"
msgstr "Richtfilter"

#. +> trunk stable
#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:197
msgid "a low value will make the direction input adapt more quickly, a high value will make it smoother"
msgstr "En siet Weert maakt de Topassen för de Richtingaav gauer, höger Weerten maakt ehr weeker."

